<%# How the map is made, in the bar: drawn (floors, walls, objects), or played on a picture of one's own (the tab
    Image). A segmented switch like the theme selector (Anthony's request): on the field background, the chosen one in
    a surface pill. Real radio buttons of one group (the arrows of the keyboard move between them), without a form:
    the editor changes the mode of the layout and saves it (map_editor_controller.js#chooseMaking), undone like a
    stroke. The drawing is kept when the picture is chosen %>
<fieldset class="flex w-full shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-field p-1 sm:w-auto">
  <legend class="sr-only"><%= t(".label") %></legend>
  <%# Each with its icon (Anthony's request: « Image » alone was not clear) %>
  <% [["draw", t(".draw"), "shared/icons/pencil"], ["picture", t(".picture"), "shared/icons/image"]].each do |mode, label, icon| %>
    <label class="<%= MapTemplatesHelper::MAKING_CHOICE_CLASSES %> cursor-pointer has-checked:bg-surface has-checked:font-semibold has-checked:shadow-sm">
      <input type="radio" name="map-making" value="<%= mode %>" class="sr-only" <%= "checked" if map_making_mode(map_template) == mode %>
             data-map-editor-target="makingChoice" data-action="change->map-editor#chooseMaking">
      <%= render icon, css_class: "size-4" %><%= label %>
    </label>
  <% end %>
</fieldset>
